Package: jellyfin-client-lite
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-textual (>= 2.1) | python3-venv, python3-requests, mpv
Recommends: mpv-mpris, playerctl, python3-pil
Conflicts: jellyfin-tui-lite
Replaces: jellyfin-tui-lite
Maintainer: ketchupboy
Homepage: https://github.com/Epiklal/jellyfin-client-lite
Description: tiny terminal music player for Jellyfin
 Shuffles your whole Jellyfin music library in the terminal. Playback is
 done by mpv without transcoding, so it stays light on CPU and RAM.
 .
 With mpv-mpris installed, media keys and the desktop's media widget work.
 Reports playback to the server (play counts, statistics) and can
 optionally show what you are listening to in Discord.
 .
 Installs its own APT source, so updates arrive with the normal system
 updates.
